            <div xml:id="d287">

                <pb facs="0380" n="268" xml:id="pg268"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/490</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Leavell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-29T11:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 29, 1918, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My telegram September 18, noon. President Cabrera assures me that he has no
                    knowledge of any such purpose but that he will not allow the purchase if it be
                    attempted.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Leavell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
